# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          — imperative, <=72 chars, no trailing period
#
# Why this change is needed (not what the diff shows). Wrap at 72.
#
# Refs: #
#
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# type:  feat fix docs test refactor perf build ci chore revert
#        append ! for a breaking change, e.g. feat(api)!:
# scope: pdf catalog assets api ui constitution   (optional; omit rather
#        than invent one)
#
# Breaking changes need a footer:
#   BREAKING CHANGE: <what broke and what to use instead>
#
# Never commit: card images, generated PDFs, caches, secrets, .env
# Full standard: CONTRIBUTING.md
